132 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 98 0 R/E(Lakewood Village is more than just a collection of streets; it is a community that looks out for its own. Following the devastating fire that damaged the home of Melanie Guiang and her family on Prescott on February 12, we have a vital opportunity to help our neighbors begin the long process of rebuilding.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

133 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 98 0 R/E(Two years ago, the LVNA Board reinstated our 501\(c\)\(3\) non-profit status specifically so we could serve as a direct channel for giving in times of crisis. It is incredibly heartening to see that a group from Fairwood has already come together to donate $1,150. We invite everyone in the village to join us in supporting Melanie and her children during this difficult transition.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

134 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 98 0 R/E(There are many ways to help, including personal GoFundMe and Venmo accounts. However, for those who prefer to give through an organization, donations made via the LVNA are 100% tax-deductible, and 100% of the funds go directly to the Guiang family.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

